      "author": "Universidad de Córdoba (UCO)",
      "description": "Temperature and humidity sensor dataset produced by the [FIWARE Digital Transformation Classroom](https://www.uco.es/atdfiware/), Universidad de Córdoba, Spain. The data is updated every 15 minutes and is available in CSV format. The dataset contains the following columns:\n\n* **entity_id**: Unique identifier for the entity (e.g., urn:ngsi-ld:atd.id1).\n* **entity_ts**: Timestamp of the data point in ISO 8601 format (e.g., 2025-04-27T15:37:51.856Z).\n* **temperature**: Temperature value in degrees Celsius (e.g., 13).\n* **humidity**: Humidity value in percentage (e.g., 79.5).\n\nAnd example of the data is as follows:\n\n```csv\n\"entity_id\",\"entity_ts\",\"temperature\",\"humidity\"\n\"urn:ngsi-ld:atd.id1\",\"2025-04-27T15:37:51.856Z\",13,79.5\n```\n",
